@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.D01_Leads.D01_LeadsModels.D01_Leads_LeadGeneratorsModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider opProv;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.D01_Leads_LeadGenerators.GetDescription()}";
}
<div id="loaderContent" class="loader-overlay-content">
    <div class="loader">
        <div class="text-orange text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x"></i>&nbsp;Loading...
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row mb-md-2">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div id="accordion">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header" id="headingOne">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">
                        <button class="btn btn-link collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                            Lead Generators <i class="fa fa-chevron-down"></i><i class="fa fa-chevron-up"></i>
                        </button>
                    </h5>
                </div>

                <div id="collapseOne" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-parent="#accordion">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <table class="table table-sm table-striped table-hover">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th scope="col">Lead Generator Name</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Created By</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Created</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Updated By</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Updated</th>
                                    <th scope="col">User Count</th>
                                    <th scope="col"></th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                                        <input class="form-control" id="add_LeadGeneratorName" type="text" placeholder="Add new item here..." />
                                    </td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap"></td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap"></td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap"></td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap"></td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap"></td>
                                    <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                                        <a onclick="DoAddLeadGenerator();" href="#" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i>&nbsp;Add</a>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                @foreach (var item in Model.D01_Leads_LeadGeneratorsItems)
                                {
                                    <tr>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                                            <input class="form-control" id="add_LeadGeneratorName@(item.ID)" type="text" value="@item.LeadGeneratorName" />
                                        </td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">@item.CreatedByUsername</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">@item.DateCreated.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">@item.UpdatedByUsername</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">@item.DateUpdated.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">@item.UserCount</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-nowrap">
                                            <a onclick="DoUpdateLeadGenerator('@(item.ID)');" href="#" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-save"></i>&nbsp;Update</a>
                                            &nbsp;
                                            @if (item.ID != 1 && item.ID != 2)
                                            {
                                                @if (item.UserCount == 0)
                                                {
                                                    <a onclick="DoDeleteLeadGenerator('@(item.ID)');" href="#" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i>&nbsp;Delete</a>
                                                }
                                            }
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header" id="headingTwo">
